  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Salvador Wastewater Energy and Operational Efficiency, through ARCADIS NV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds the Salvador Wastewater Energy and Operational Efficiency Feasibility Study for the Empresa Baiana de Aguas e Saneamento S.A. (Embasa) in Bahia, Brazil. This study will evaluate the technical, economic and financial feasibility of implementing various energy efficiency modernizations in the larger Salvador metropolitan area wastewater treatment system.</narrative>
